<title>CHILE: Cristalerias reports lower 9-month net.</title>
<headline>Cristalerias reports lower 9-month net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glassmaker Cristalerias de Chile reported the following results in the first nine months of 1996 against the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>				 9-mo 1996		9-mo 1995</p>
<p>Net profit		    7.37			8.17</p>
<p>Operating profit	    7.61			7.21</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	  987 million	   2.11</p>
<p>Total revenues	     23.11		     21.47</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos except where noted.</p>
<p>-- Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211</p>
</text>
